WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.606 --> 00:00:08.251
(soft happy music)

00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:09.728
- [Voiceover] Dear BuzzFeed,

00:00:09.728 --> 00:00:12.063
My name is Joshua
Gonzalez and I'm a senior

00:00:12.063 --> 00:00:15.300
at University of Detroit
Jesuit High School.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:18.294
All my life, I've aimed
to spread love and hope

00:00:18.294 --> 00:00:20.373
to everyone I've encountered.

00:00:20.373 --> 00:00:23.797
This desire to serve has
led my classmates and I

00:00:23.797 --> 00:00:26.352
to form a new ministry we call

00:00:26.352 --> 00:00:28.396
The Pallbearer Ministry.

00:00:28.396 --> 00:00:31.575
This ministry's aim is to
serve homeless veterans

00:00:31.575 --> 00:00:33.247
and other homeless people

00:00:33.247 --> 00:00:37.048
who have little to no loved
ones present at their funeral.

00:00:37.048 --> 00:00:39.328
As pallbearers, we ultimately become

00:00:39.328 --> 00:00:42.171
the person's family or loved one.

00:00:42.171 --> 00:00:44.388
My classmates and I believe that everyone

00:00:44.388 --> 00:00:48.033
deserves to be honored
with dignity and respect

00:00:48.033 --> 00:00:51.226
as they are brought to
their final resting place.

00:00:51.226 --> 00:00:53.218
We act as pallbearers to honor

00:00:53.218 --> 00:00:56.498
the brave veterans who sacrificed for us.

00:00:56.498 --> 00:00:58.158
Whatever your calling is,

00:00:58.158 --> 00:01:00.306
I think getting involved in your community

00:01:00.306 --> 00:01:03.197
would ultimately change
you for the better.

00:01:03.197 --> 00:01:06.088
We, the members of The
Pallbearer Ministry,

00:01:06.088 --> 00:01:09.860
have acquired so much from
the sentiment of service.

00:01:09.860 --> 00:01:12.542
I feel truly blessed
to have the opportunity

00:01:12.542 --> 00:01:17.203
to provide dignity to the
people who truly deserve it.

00:01:17.203 --> 00:01:19.159
What I learned from this experience

00:01:19.159 --> 00:01:22.723
is that everyone has the
capacity and capability

00:01:22.723 --> 00:01:26.642
to do great things and
to pursue their calling.

00:01:26.642 --> 00:01:28.925
No matter the size of the challenge,

00:01:28.925 --> 00:01:31.430
or the enormity of the odds,

00:01:31.430 --> 00:01:35.583
finding ways to help others
ultimately benefits us all.

00:01:35.583 --> 00:01:36.967
Thank you.

00:01:36.967 --> 00:01:38.546
Thanks for listening,

00:01:38.546 --> 00:01:41.095
Joshua Gonzalez.

